# [RTGWG](../wg/rtgwg.html)

## Summary
The Routing Working Group (RTGWG) met at IETF 120. The session covered working group status updates, active working group draft progressions (including multi-segment SD-WAN and ATN BGP-based mobile routing), problem statements regarding IGP information offloading, multiple proposals on link overload alleviation and traffic engineering, HPC/AI cluster routing and data models, quantum key distribution (QKD) key relay via SRv6, mega-constellation LEO satellite network routing requirements, and adaptive routing frameworks. The chairs strongly encouraged authors of overlapping overload alleviation drafts to consolidate their efforts.

