## Decisions and Action Items
- **VRRP BFD Drafts:** Proceed to Working Group Last Call for both `draft-ietf-rtgwg-vrrp-bfd-p2p` and `draft-ietf-rtgwg-vrrp-p2mp-bfd`.
- **SRv6 Egress Protection:** Prepare `draft-ietf-rtgwg-srv6-egress-protection` for WGLC after IETF 120, following the split of encoding elements into LSR.
- **Overload Alleviation Drafts:** Authors of the various link overload and bandwidth-aware routing proposals (EBR, BBEAR, local congestion avoidance, common approaches) are requested by the chairs to collaborate and consolidate their work.
- **Multi-segment SD-WAN:** Request a formal directorate review for `draft-ietf-rtgwg-multisegment-sdwan` to evaluate recent updates before initiating a new WGLC.
- **ATN BGP Mobile Routing:** Working Group chairs to coordinate offline with Fred Templin on handling normative downref dependencies with 6MAN documents for `draft-ietf-rtgwg-atn-bgp`, and request a review from BGPDIR.

